## Title: Better Character Overview
## Author: Copper
## Version: 1.16.0
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## AddOnVersion: 11600
## Description: Adds a native All Inventories page to the PS5 gamepad Inventory with compact item-location details, cross-character currencies, furnishing preview, furnishings grouped by furniture category and subcategory (/bcosub) and cataloged from bank, housing storage, and owned houses, guild store listings per guild, and All/Banked/Characters/Storage/Listed source filters, excluding the Craft Bag. Every item tooltip also counts the item in each place the account holds it: bag, bank, housing storage, Furnishing Vault, characters, owned houses and guild store listings.
